This is a placeholder for the 180x180 Apple touch icon. You'll need to replace this with an actual PNG image.

Apple touch icon requirements:
- Size: 180x180 pixels
- Format: PNG
- No transparency (iOS adds rounded corners automatically)
- No border (iOS adds border automatically)

Recommended design:
- Background: Black (#000000)
- Primary: Yellow (#FFCC00)
- Icon: Flame symbol
- Text: "RoxPT" or just flame icon
- Ensure good contrast for visibility

